WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.786
This is a supplied fictional intake tabletop. The

00:00:02.844 --> 00:00:05.991
polished cover says ready for any business. READY

00:00:06.037 --> 00:00:10.565
Quality Review asks five different questions. Relevant: does

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:14.048
the work serve its approved need? Evidenced: can

00:00:14.106 --> 00:00:16.811
a reader find the claims, sources, and tests?

00:00:17.462 --> 00:00:21.606
Accountable: who reviews and corrects it? Designed: can

00:00:21.641 --> 00:00:25.269
the audience use and understand it? Yours: can

00:00:25.316 --> 00:00:28.404
the author explain personal judgment and AI assistance

00:00:28.439 --> 00:00:32.827
truthfully? The supplied records support a reviewed fictional

00:00:32.885 --> 00:00:36.148
tabletop. They do not establish live delivery or

00:00:36.241 --> 00:00:40.292
universal suitability. Include meaningful test references and narrow

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:42.986
the claim. Keep this review distinct from the

00:00:43.067 --> 00:00:46.515
earlier READY Automation Screen. AI can help identify

00:00:46.597 --> 00:00:50.246
gaps. It cannot assign a certification decision. Your

00:00:50.292 --> 00:00:52.811
own review needs evidence from your actual package.
